# A Round 1 results bundle downloaded to the repo root. results_bundle,
# results_bundle (1) and results_bundle (2) are tracked and stay tracked --
# gitignore does not untrack them. This entry is for the later download only,
# which is a duplicate of evidence already committed and has no reason to be
# staged again.
#
# It matters beyond tidiness: provenance() flags an artifact dirty from any
# untracked path, so while this sat here every generated artifact recorded
# dirty: true. Those flags are accurate but they point at a file unrelated to
# the work that produced them.
results_bundle (3)/
